imated plans as before.\n\nFailed owner run `20261108T213706Z-b0798be83c64c6dc5992bed4adae8ed5` completed all 1000 commits \/ 100M rows in approximately 945.88 seconds, then failed with `Incorrect syntax near 'WHEREs'.` in ObserveSql; release encountered the same SQL defect. It produced zero successful measured COUNTs. The raw run exited1; `docker stop --time 20` ended the primary at137, cleanup failed and the owned stage was retained. These remain failure evidence. The first fixture's PK page metadata reported `used_bytes=65,222,975,488` and `reserved_bytes=65,231,323,136`; preflight host free was 164,172,894,208 bytes. Two-node AG restore plus indexes\/logs\/tempdb\/backups has a narrow capacity margin. Ordered loading does not establish capacity sufficiency; all existing gates and actual resulting page\/plan checks remain mandatory.\n","old":"Exactly 100,000,000 rows, 100 stored columns, 404 logical bytes before engine overhead. BIGINT precedes all offset\/multiplication; `c001` varied, `c002` 80% zero, `c003` high-cardinality, `c004..99` constant. One 1000 × 100k committed load, no second INSERT copy or full-target validation COUNT. Every commit receipt must match its exact contiguous ID boundaries and post-COMMIT transaction count zero.\n","path":"sqlserver\/manual-count-100m\/README.md"},{"new":"engine internals, COUNT hints\/MAXDOP changes, COUNT(1),","old":"engine internals, hints\/MAXDOP, COUNT(1),","path":"sqlserver\/manual-count-100m\/README.md"},{"new":"After CREATE TABLE and the actual 100-column geometry\/settings checks, before the first fixture INSERT, run the actual preload monitor smoke on the new empty fixture. Two dedicated unpooled connections obtain independent Guard identities. The admin executes the same ObserveSql used by monitoring; the observed live connection GUID and Idle(false) must match, and Guard rechecks immutable identity. Release independently proves the open session idle. Both smoke connections are then disposed and independently verified absent through Release\/Idle(true) before load begins. Guard uses only the manual prefix; this smoke executes no Target COUNT and adds no condition\/sample to the eighteen slots. Persist status, identities, SQL, observation, errors and release flags in `preload-monitor-smoke.json` and `probe.preload_monitor_smoke`, with the Release histories under `cleanup\/`. Any smoke or connection-release failure aborts before insertion and prevents acceptance. The offline suite checks acceptance bookkeeping; actual SQL regression coverage occurs only in the owner's fresh all execution.\n\nBefore each cell: exact frozen inventory\/guard\/role SQL,","old":"Before each cell: exact frozen inventory\/guard\/role SQL,","path":"sqlserver\/manual-count-100m\/README.md"},{"new":"Six-hour root deadline plus independent cleanup240 seconds;","old":"Six-hour root deadline plus independent cleanup120 seconds;","path":"sqlserver\/manual-count-100m\/README.md"},{"new":"Each SQL server gets60 seconds for orderly shutdown with a bounded65-second stop CLI; the client retains its20\/25-second stop\/CLI bounds. Each started SQL server must exit0; forced\/nonzero\/OOM exits and stop errors remain cleanup failures and preserve the stage.","old":"Each started SQL server must exit0, not OOM\/137; stop errors preserved.","path":"sqlserver\/manual-count-100m\/README.md"},{"new":"Owner offline pass is not that acceptance.","old":"Author offline pass is not that acceptance.","path":"sqlserver\/manual-count-100m\/README.md"}],"status":"proposal_ready","unresolvedIssues":["The proposal is uncompiled and unexecuted. Actual monitor SQL, disposal\/release smoke, ordered loading and orderly shutdown require the owner's fresh all run.","Ordered loading has no measured space or speed improvement yet; two-node AG capacity remains uncertain and must pass unchanged capacity gates.","A60-second server shutdown grace is unverified on this workload. Forced\/nonzero\/OOM shutdown must still fail cleanup.","Durin